  "text": "Thank you, Mr. Bell, for flagging that immediately. That's a critical change — the gymnasium is off the table for next Thursday, and we need to update the draft plan to reflect the cafeteria as the reunification site. That's noted for the record. Now, before we move on, I want to make sure we still hear from Mr. Rios on language access and Nurse Okafor on medication storage, since both of those issues may also interact with the site change — for example, medication storage logistics could differ in the cafeteria versus the gymnasium. Mr. Rios, please go ahead with your language access findings, and then Nurse Okafor, we'll hear your medication storage concern. Ms. Hart, I appreciate your patience — we'll get to the transportation wave issue right after."
}
